        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #7 Large Reed Entry Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design 20\" door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis entry door handle is assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. Available in 12 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions #7 Large Reed Front Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet long. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard for  Surface Mounting with #10 x 1-1/2\" screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Ball and Reed Front Door Handle, First Impressions #7A",
                "description": "First Impressions #7A Decorative Door Pulls. Stunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors.  Available in 20 or 24 inch lengths and 12 different finish colors. ",
                "keywords": "FII-7A Large Reed Front Door Handles, Large Ball and Reed Front Door Handles, First Impressions # 7 Decorative Door Pulls, Large Commercial Entry Door Handles, first impressions #7  Large Reed Entry Door Pulls, First Impressions # 7A decorative Reed Door Handles, FII-7B 24 inch door handles, FII-7A 20 inch door handles,"
